{"2707630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Twins of Olus", "steam_appid": 2707630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707630/extras/0c9a461d40b6659b5e7bbddab3822a4e.avif?t=1785246552\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 years ago, the invasion began. Thousands were hunted, captured and possessed. Now your training is complete and it's time to dive into exhilarating battles against your corrupted foes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Twins of Olus, you take control of Lions, an orphaned Uthran native and his spectral partner Creo as they emerge from years of hiding after an otherworldly force invaded their homeland. Players will master the art of dual combat, seamlessly switching between characters as they battle their way through hordes of creatures, solve puzzles, collect power ups and meet plenty of quirky allies along the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By exploring a beautifully crafted world filled with secrets and challenges through fast paced traversal - coupled with a little creative thinking - only you can uncover the intent and identity of the nefarious force pillaging Lions' home world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707630/extras/40fc56c5a5cd649e4b63c63a6a522c4a.avif?t=1785246552\" width=616 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707630/extras/1e7eb6597aaa594ab48e441aff9d0594.avif?t=1785246552\" width=616 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Control two characters in tandem to experience a co-op adventure as a solo player. Seamlessly swap between playstyles to make the most of either characters best attributes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707630/extras/f361a522c23651645ccb0d6a2bab4f45.avif?t=1785246552\" width=616 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707630/extras/5884d516047e8b809ef4a78f61230430.avif?t=1785246552\" width=616 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Travel together day and night uncovering alternative routes as the sun rises and sets on each region. Encounter curious and remarkable creatures who may aid or deceive you during the journey.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707630/extras/0d5506ba3c03dc8340f54b9ff2c63572.avif?t=1785246552\" width=616 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707630/extras/588d8777dba9ebae769727221107a0c0.avif?t=1785246552\" width=616 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dash, launch &amp; jolt at high velocity to cover vast stretches of terrain. Activate spectral bridges shared between the living and the dead to reach places once forgotten. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707630/extras/7a55de14ded03866fbc3c8be9973eceb.avif?t=1785246552\" width=616 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707630/extras/4c87931071a6996779c5809cd6f738d8.avif?t=1785246552\" width=616 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enlist a squad of potent creatures that will lend you their powerful combat enhancements. Gather rare materials along the way to  unleash the full potential of their skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707630/extras/23e09fc3751f42cc197f0ddf0aa24564.avif?t=1785246552\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707630/extras/f166b37412bc541c2e044c05347b6c7d.avif?t=1785246552\" width=616 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op puts you and a friend in control of each character individually to create a new way of adventuring together.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707630/extras/0c9a461d40b6659b5e7bbddab3822a4e.avif?t=1785246552\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 years ago, the invasion began. Thousands were hunted, captured and possessed. Now your training is complete and it's time to dive into exhilarating battles against your corrupted foes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Twins of Olus, you take control of Lions, an orphaned Uthran native and his spectral partner Creo as they emerge from years of hiding after an otherworldly force invaded their homeland. Players will master the art of dual combat, seamlessly switching between characters as they battle their way through hordes of creatures, solve puzzles, collect power ups and meet plenty of quirky allies along the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By exploring a beautifully crafted world filled with secrets and challenges through fast paced traversal - coupled with a little creative thinking - only you can uncover the intent and identity of the nefarious force pillaging Lions' home world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707630/extras/40fc56c5a5cd649e4b63c63a6a522c4a.avif?t=1785246552\" width=616 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707630/extras/1e7eb6597aaa594ab48e441aff9d0594.avif?t=1785246552\" width=616 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Control two characters in tandem to experience a co-op adventure as a solo player. Seamlessly swap between playstyles to make the most of either characters best attributes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707630/extras/f361a522c23651645ccb0d6a2bab4f45.avif?t=1785246552\" width=616 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707630/extras/5884d516047e8b809ef4a78f61230430.avif?t=1785246552\" width=616 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Travel together day and night uncovering alternative routes as the sun rises and sets on each region. Encounter curious and remarkable creatures who may aid or deceive you during the journey.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707630/extras/0d5506ba3c03dc8340f54b9ff2c63572.avif?t=1785246552\" width=616 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707630/extras/588d8777dba9ebae769727221107a0c0.avif?t=1785246552\" width=616 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dash, launch &amp; jolt at high velocity to cover vast stretches of terrain. Activate spectral bridges shared between the living and the dead to reach places once forgotten. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707630/extras/7a55de14ded03866fbc3c8be9973eceb.avif?t=1785246552\" width=616 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707630/extras/4c87931071a6996779c5809cd6f738d8.avif?t=1785246552\" width=616 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enlist a squad of potent creatures that will lend you their powerful combat enhancements. Gather rare materials along the way to  unleash the full potential of their skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707630/extras/23e09fc3751f42cc197f0ddf0aa24564.avif?t=1785246552\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707630/extras/f166b37412bc541c2e044c05347b6c7d.avif?t=1785246552\" width=616 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op puts you and a friend in control of each character individually to create a new way of adventuring together.</p>", "short_description": "Twins of Olus is a narrative dr